{"Hello! I am Bobo. Let's read a story together!":"3eb87517f885bc94.mp3","Hello! I am Nibbles. Let's read a story together!":"8d9288ed355d5065.mp3","Hello! I am Pip. Let's read a story together!":"436f1e8f22b0a965.mp3","Hello! I am Bruno. Let's read a story together!":"aa2bd6c2a5e3fb4c.mp3","Hello! I am Honey. Let's read a story together!":"ff681d9aa8bb8a6e.mp3","Hello! I am Tumble. Let's read a story together!":"c82ef0cbbcd2369a.mp3","Hello! I am Ducky. Let's read a story together!":"c8479897cdd9dcaa.mp3","Hello! I am Splash. Let's read a story together!":"0bc0353af9b86c91.mp3","Hello! I am Momo. Let's read a story together!":"26beb5505184b4ce.mp3","Hello! I am Mimi. Let's read a story together!":"bdc966958d6c0a0f.mp3","Hello! I am Pounce. Let's read a story together!":"efb98c05b3e1c755.mp3","Hello! I am Whiskers. Let's read a story together!":"a3d1c8aa23a99ae5.mp3","I don't know many words yet. Will you help me learn them?":"73774363c0e57061.mp3","Once upon a time, there were three little pigs.":"9a1f1aa4c1cf837f.mp3","The first little pig built his house out of straw.":"b358ec0d3572c300.mp3","The second little pig built his house out of sticks.":"c37cd5365874ea82.mp3","And the third little pig built his house out of strong red bricks.":"f96786a83e5b4467.mp3","But then, along came a big bad wolf!":"25b92ea16e78b99f.mp3","The wolf knocked on the door. Little pig, little pig, let me come in!":"c4d7e6c0c603c030.mp3","Not by the hair of my chinny chin chin!":"b1105ff675d7bbb6.mp3","Then I'll huff, and I'll puff, and I'll blow your house down! Blow with me! Blow into the phone!":"57619c960a78005c.mp3","Whooosh! You did it! The straw house blew away!":"509ec24a27388124.mp3","Whooosh! And the straw house blew away!":"caeb47a9b6d6f8e8.mp3","The first little pig ran to the house made of sticks!":"1d01fea033a8adda.mp3","But the wolf huffed, and he puffed, and he blew that house down too!":"2be9677379b236a4.mp3","So both little pigs ran to the house made of bricks.":"6be63261a06daf8e.mp3","The wolf huffed. And he puffed. And he huffed and he puffed.":"c14821d197d16309.mp3","But the brick house did not fall down. Bricks are too strong!":"c3021fb906542c4a.mp3","So the sneaky wolf climbed up onto the roof, and down the chimney!":"46a0b4471c866a70.mp3","But the clever little pigs had something waiting for him.":"980dc1be8341c3d2.mp3","Splash! Right into the big hot pot!":"4deee7bab09b8039.mp3","The wolf jumped up, ran out of the door, and never ever came back!":"e9828c7cc3f33cf6.mp3","And the three little pigs lived happily ever after. The end!":"443fc29d47cbb51c.mp3","Look how many words you taught me! Thank you!":"8e6e4e267f9c3b06.mp3","Ooh! What is that?":"9269efa883d4ae14.mp3","You said it! Thank you for teaching me!":"26dc2de27a35a2c7.mp3","It's a little pig!":"442b025c583d60f2.mp3","That was a pig. I will remember!":"d2cac294568482a9.mp3","Your turn! Can you say pig?":"1c27b196a8b7be40.mp3","In Spanish, we say el cerdito.":"1b22b433622e1937.mp3","pig":"ecd23d3fad020192.mp3","In Spanish, el cerdito":"04f1f73ad8524c0d.mp3","That house is made of straw.":"187a52f5847ea7cd.mp3","Straw. I will remember that!":"6244fdf0ea38e37e.mp3","Your turn! Can you say straw?":"3cc330c3ef68433b.mp3","In Spanish, we say la paja.":"527b69f7356c653a.mp3","straw":"ba06d2c0f1f5c537.mp3","In Spanish, la paja":"273bde64cf60c379.mp3","That house is made of sticks.":"6e5c6c59dc249d6a.mp3","Sticks. I will remember that!":"72479324e4684c00.mp3","Your turn! Can you say sticks?":"9c53ca175e79b6c3.mp3","In Spanish, we say los palos.":"6c93fe37222e1aa9.mp3","sticks":"60b8be8abdf98330.mp3","In Spanish, los palos":"4bf3eeacce63feaf.mp3","That house is made of strong bricks.":"263dfed1a19ce816.mp3","Bricks. I will remember that!":"c96ca64acb1bed3d.mp3","Your turn! Can you say bricks?":"ff28a9348b48d29c.mp3","In Spanish, we say los ladrillos.":"c646f56d464ca311.mp3","bricks":"034c42a9bc851839.mp3","In Spanish, los ladrillos":"10a3bdf230b716ca.mp3","It's a big bad wolf!":"24c2ac9c220fac62.mp3","That was a wolf. I will remember!":"deb85704d2dab86c.mp3","Your turn! Can you say wolf?":"033900dd2d64c5e6.mp3","In Spanish, we say el lobo.":"3b8e61d517a54756.mp3","wolf":"82c9eb80a2049fa7.mp3","In Spanish, el lobo":"0ff50748ecf17bd7.mp3","That is the chimney, on top of the roof.":"51f4d9f269226ef9.mp3","A chimney. I will remember that!":"b57e47aa07875c5b.mp3","Your turn! Can you say chimney?":"f3bcf746d32703bc.mp3","In Spanish, we say la chimenea.":"121372cc574d9de6.mp3","chimney":"f463ec81e660131a.mp3","In Spanish, la chimenea":"9758ad28f7e723b3.mp3","It's a big hot pot!":"c121dbea4a22e782.mp3","A pot. I will remember that!":"dd8857b98b57fc58.mp3","Your turn! Can you say pot?":"ce204fe9dedbaa98.mp3","In Spanish, we say la olla.":"391a232c97d2d262.mp3","pot":"2860488bc592a40c.mp3","In Spanish, la olla":"a5781d668ad2311b.mp3","Who wants to come with you today?":"e5c943cf414d9d49.mp3","Hooray! My name is Bobo!":"3bb60f5574c2fb34.mp3","Hooray! My name is Nibbles!":"4b2cdcd314c96bd4.mp3","Hooray! My name is Pip!":"3edcab4f98994e72.mp3","Hooray! My name is Bruno!":"8d9cec03d006af41.mp3","Hooray! My name is Honey!":"bee52667dda13ed6.mp3","Hooray! My name is Tumble!":"8d753941d25edd8c.mp3","Hooray! My name is Ducky!":"5753364313a7e58e.mp3","Hooray! My name is Splash!":"bd3fd0652c23c334.mp3","Hooray! My name is Momo!":"e7a30d885c46a83e.mp3","Hooray! My name is Mimi!":"482f99f9b515b0cb.mp3","Hooray! My name is Pounce!":"9cdf898fc41239ff.mp3","Hooray! My name is Whiskers!":"7f533191247cd459.mp3","What shall we call your bunny?":"fdf4cac73f10a4d4.mp3","What shall we call your bear?":"705d032f5fc00c5a.mp3","What shall we call your duck?":"182c38a76e968ca7.mp3","What shall we call your cat?":"d7c7037e874c5c00.mp3","Hello again! This one is my favourite. Will you help me learn?":"b6e5a3492c26ed16.mp3","In a sunny little garden, there lived an itsy bitsy spider.":"830c5ea1ab0fbc13.mp3","Beside the wall stood a tall metal water spout.":"dee0980496e261b9.mp3","The itsy bitsy spider wanted to climb all the way to the top.":"ba71370e3978a1c5.mp3","The itsy bitsy spider climbed up the water spout.":"c75c821042ec0583.mp3","But high above, the sky began to fill with big grey clouds.":"4a2c1b105f1ede37.mp3","Down came the rain, and washed the spider out!":"af5d64024a7614c5.mp3","Poor itsy bitsy spider. She was all the way back down, and very very wet.":"585dacac786bd81d.mp3","Can you help? Blow the rain clouds away! Blow into the phone!":"6d67412f3ff1d051.mp3","You did it! The clouds went whooshing away!":"bc698fc763675572.mp3","And slowly, the clouds went whooshing away.":"f53e01e6dfbb47da.mp3","Out came the sun, and dried up all the rain!":"6c3c2e0f4f31c599.mp3","The spider shook herself off. She was warm and dry again.":"f3fe3d3c9a167102.mp3","And the itsy bitsy spider climbed up the spout again!":"94f049a8eefc2b01.mp3","Up and up and up, all the way to the very top!":"f55f08897167f8d7.mp3","And there, in the sunshine, she made a beautiful silver web.":"4415f59411c5b1c9.mp3","The itsy bitsy spider never ever gave up. The end!":"e029d9f9e371a7a7.mp3","You taught me so many words today! Thank you!":"56b80b96cf3daf04.mp3","That's a little spider!":"3fe89b43c5d3c1ef.mp3","A spider. I will remember that!":"d721e6bef0330735.mp3","Your turn! Can you say spider?":"fd1d2a38cbcd438c.mp3","In Spanish, we say la araña.":"eb4f046e55923cbb.mp3","spider":"8967be742541226e.mp3","In Spanish, la araña":"b4f4f6cb94b18277.mp3","That is the water spout, a big metal pipe.":"095648b2e839fd78.mp3","A spout. I will remember that!":"e2f4c503c5694e94.mp3","Your turn! Can you say spout?":"0da90bce1df32ab4.mp3","In Spanish, we say el canalón.":"6df77a472a855ffc.mp3","spout":"6d683555ea1fba4d.mp3","In Spanish, el canalón":"481af242b62cd37b.mp3","She is going up, up, up!":"9a462184f7d39ef8.mp3","Up. I will remember that!":"1e29581fcce61089.mp3","Your turn! Can you say up?":"63c75774efab7b6d.mp3","In Spanish, we say arriba.":"9a2662a71b6328e9.mp3","up":"753ae0eaa5bc4bae.mp3","In Spanish, arriba":"97a8c313dc8193de.mp3","That's a big grey rain cloud.":"c390c27e94e3569b.mp3","A cloud. I will remember that!":"126d93f6de45b4cf.mp3","Your turn! Can you say cloud?":"ff47ec498dbfbf63.mp3","In Spanish, we say la nube.":"955d087a05e0f5f4.mp3","cloud":"5f7d143ae25de2aa.mp3","In Spanish, la nube":"afac35817a1bf886.mp3","That's the rain, falling down.":"6780caafb7e3c78e.mp3","Rain. I will remember that!":"9533106e32548fed.mp3","Your turn! Can you say rain?":"68b974fbb97e55f0.mp3","In Spanish, we say la lluvia.":"cd28cb31d18f1756.mp3","rain":"2e858e89f50bb1e4.mp3","In Spanish, la lluvia":"4da4f95bc53497b9.mp3","Oh no, she washed all the way down!":"a5d16c91482e2744.mp3","Down. I will remember that!":"dd739489d0fc4f38.mp3","Your turn! Can you say down?":"b5d77bd56d622160.mp3","In Spanish, we say abajo.":"a5051bbab2816371.mp3","down":"9354b9299d3ff3cd.mp3","In Spanish, abajo":"221fe811e5901294.mp3","Here comes the warm yellow sun!":"d85f3362d50d4d54.mp3","The sun. I will remember that!":"801b270b3be4d36b.mp3","Your turn! Can you say sun?":"85d5a6f42efa5957.mp3","In Spanish, we say el sol.":"9b281b04e1e9c5cd.mp3","sun":"89b5a5d70e124d60.mp3","In Spanish, el sol":"df5fa17cbe6c5a3f.mp3","She made a beautiful spider web.":"427d17330c3114e1.mp3","A web. I will remember that!":"4e0db59ea5270e8f.mp3","Your turn! Can you say web?":"dbff7575f63be474.mp3","In Spanish, we say la telaraña.":"9bafea891198648b.mp3","web":"cd102b4c0d5e8d91.mp3","In Spanish, la telaraña":"ff45ce45e61c9be2.mp3","Look, a rainbow in the sky!":"f6b57396b6c9071b.mp3","A rainbow. I will remember that!":"dc4a1e46ac0ca526.mp3","Your turn! Can you say rainbow?":"50931d89089b74f5.mp3","In Spanish, we say el arcoíris.":"1f2021f6fc281c65.mp3","rainbow":"67e1c8a1b6c25063.mp3","In Spanish, el arcoíris":"47d2f10bd2af596a.mp3"}